during system development. The numbered arrows show the order in which a team
might develop and use the application: </p>

<p class="MsoListNumber2" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo7">&lt;![if !supportLists]&gt;<span style="mso-list:Ignore">1.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>    
</span></span>&lt;![endif]&gt;With a FIT test harness driving the application and
using the mock (in-memory) database substituting for the real database; </p>

<p class="MsoListNumber2" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo7">&lt;![if !supportLists]&gt;<span style="mso-list:Ignore">2.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>    
</span></span>&lt;![endif]&gt;Adding a GUI to the application, still running off the
